window.products.push({"id":660079,"name":"Spewahom Set of 2 Soft Velvet Decorative Throw Pillow Covers 12x20 Inch Teal Golden Double-Sided Printed Boho Cushion Cover Case Lumbar Pillowcase for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BDjGgKLJL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"To add a splash color for your lovely home, Spewahom, whose aim is making excellent home decorations will be a good choice. With high quality and good value, Spewahom has been hearing the voice from many loving life people — I love these awesome pillow covers! Beautiful modern decorative throw pillow covers are delicate and distinct, they work vividly with any theme home decor. They help to create a cozy and inviting atmosphere no matter where you put them. Product Information: Brand: Spewahom Size: 12 x 20 inches,every package includes set of 2 throw pillow covers and do not come with the inside pillow. Color: Teal watercolor,the bright and colorful patterns are printed on the Both sides. Material:Soft velvet Features: These pillowcase are made of high quality polyester, skin friendly to you and your families. Hidden zipper closure, smooth and neat. Perfect addition to your couch, sofa, bedroom, bench, living room, office, indoor and outdoor. Washing Instructions: Hand wash the pillow covers with cold water and soap ; If machine washing, use only cold water and make sure to use a gentle cycle. Do not add bleach. When machine drying, use low-heat setting if your dryer has one. If it does not,  hang the pillowcase to air dry. Do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BDjGgKLJL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spewahom","source_asin":"B09TSMMSJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TSMMSJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TSMMSJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
