window.products.push({"id":660139,"name":"Plastic Fruit Fork Spears Set of 6 Birdies with Tree Shaped Holder, Fancy Toothpicks, Assorted Color Mini Skewers for Cheese Cubes, Bento Box, Crudité","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61254GvtzlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make noshing fun again! These days we all are so busy that a big meal isn’t always on the menu. We’ve learned that grazing is just as good. Some watermelon here, some cheese cubes there. . . not to mention veggies! Why not create a plate of fun with our cheery and colorful plastic fruit fork spears! This set of 6 birdie sticks are made from 100% recyclable non-toxic, food-safe plastic. The sweet little reusable toothpicks slip into small holes in a brightly-hued plastic tree-shaped stand, and look as if they are perched on top! You will love these decorative serving toothpicks so much – you won’t run out of ways to use them. As with all sharp objects, keep away from small children. But they can be enjoyed by older kids and adults at your gatherings. And what’s really great is that each stick is a different color so guests won't mix up their sticks! When not in use, store them easily in a kitchen cupboard or display them. . . anywhere! Hand wash and use over and over again! Order now to bring some fun into your life! Your birds and tree holder will be sent in random colors, but all different colors. We’re sure your love your 6 birdie sticks perched on a tree, but if not, we offer a money-back guarantee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61254GvtzlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeMG","source_asin":"B01LY7V5CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LY7V5CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LY7V5CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
