window.products.push({"id":660228,"name":"Hawaiian Shaved Ice S900A Shaved Ice and Snow Cone Machine with 6 Flavor Syrup Pack and Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":83.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Igxp6hWzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make powdery snow right in your own kitchen with the S900A Electric Shaved Ice Machine. Make a margarita, slushie, granita, iced coffee, or any other frozen snowball treat you can think of. Your own icy treat station at home. The Hawaiian Shaved Ice countertop snocone maker is simple to use and clean. Portable, easy to store when not in use. Use cube ice, bagged ice, or make your own blocks of ice. Set includes all the supplies needed to get the party started - machine, 6 - 16oz. plastic syrup bottles with red Cherry, Grape, Blue Raspberry, Tiger’s Blood, Lemon-Lime, and Pina Colada flavors, plus accessories: 25 snow cone cups, 25 spoon straws, and 6 black bottle pourers. Keep a bag of ice cubes in your freezer for snowcone emergencies! Each 16oz. bottle makes approximately 8 six-ounce perfectly-flavored snow cones. With a 2-ounce pour, the entire kit can make about 50 six-ounce snow cones. Make it “skinny” by using a little less. Not just for a shaved ice or snow cone machine! Add a dash of flavor to nearly anything with this variety of options at a great value. Standard 120-volt electrical plug-in. The S900A electric shaved ice machine easy to operate and stores conveniently away when not in use. Our syrups are best for food allergies. Shelf-stable high fructose corn syrup requires no refrigeration and is nut-free. None of the flavors contain soy, wheat, dairy, starch, flour, or egg products. Most syrups have a shelf life of 2 to 3 years. Not from concentrate, no need to add water. Syrup Flavors: Cherry, Grape, Blue Raspberry, Tiger’s Blood, Lemon-Lime, and Pina Colada. Check out our store with more great flavor options. Give your blender a break and put a new twist on your evening cocktail, add flavor to your margarita, Coke, and other drinks like granitas, seltzers, Italian soda, icee, black coffee, hot chocolate, slushie, smoothies, shakes, popsicles, cola, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Igxp6hWzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hawaiian Shaved Ice","source_asin":"B078NDQVQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078NDQVQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078NDQVQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
