window.products.push({"id":660349,"name":"Flask Gift Box - Personalized Flask Set in RoseWood Box with 6oz Stainless Steel Flask, 4 Shot Glasses, Flask Funnel. Groomsmen Flasks, Bridesmaids' G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919EMHRw8iL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The powder coated stainless steel flasks holds 6 oz. and each set comes with four stainless steel shot cups and a funnel for easy pouring, all housed in a classic rosewood finish box. Gift box dimensions: 9.5\" x 7\" x 2\". The personalized stainless steel flasks are specially designed for your wedding party gifts including bridesmaids and groomsmen custom gifts. They are permanently laser etched with a design and text of your choice. Simple select the color of the flask, then design (A, B, C,..) and type in the text/name/wedding date/year for that design. You can change anything in the design if you like. Please feel free to let us know. The engraved design has classic glossy silver color, and can not be scratched off. These personalized flasks make great gifts as birthday flask, GROOMSMEN FLASKS, best man flask, rehearsal dinners gifts, wedding party gifts, bridesmaids flasks, bachelor parties gifts, father of the bride gift, father of the groom gift, and overall great personalized gifts for anyone else in your wedding party. ****** Design Credit: Erin Fellows at Factory Enova. *** ORDER INSTRUCTION: 1) For example, you selected Matte Black Flask, and Design A, the engraved text will be as followed: Line 1 \"BEST MAN\", Line 2 \"JUSTIN\", Line 3 \"05.29.2016\". 2) If you need more than one of the gift boxes, with different name/date/title, please add to cart each gift box individually so that we can obtain all the needed information (you can complete the checkout in one time and save on shipping as well). *** 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED! We are proud to provide custom engraving service for your special day. We process each order carefully and control its quality to ensure you receive the best engraving possible. If you have any questions, please do not hesitant to ask!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919EMHRw8iL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01HW07OE0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HW07OE0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HW07OE0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
