window.products.push({"id":660376,"name":"Artdix Cordless Roman Shades Window Shades - Grey 23 W x 72L Inches Fabric Lined Custom Geometric Roman Shades Blinds for Windows, Doors, French Doors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":105.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k9TT5Y5LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"①BLACKOUT LINED ROMAN SHADE: The geometric roman shades are highly functional and just a bit casual, our custom fabric Roman Shades ensure that the windows themselves are part of the view. The blackout lined roman shades are constructed with 2 layers fabric, beige liner backing, make the roman blinds to keep out 100% SUNLIGHT and UV RAY. No chemical coating, safe to environment. Ideal use for windows, doors, French door, sliding doors, kitchen, bedroom. Machine or hand washable. Tumble dry. ② CONFIRM ORDER IN 24 HRS: We will send a confirmation email within 24 hrs. We can change color and tiny size adjustment for free. The sooner you reply, the sooner you get the roman shade. HARDWARE INCLUDED: The hardware and lift mechanism will be sent together with the roman blind. The pull bead is installed by default on the right. If you need left installed, please send message to us in 24 hrs. You can also call or text us: (929)300-3678 ③ INSIDE MOUNT: For inside mounting, the roman shade width needs to be 0.4 inch less than your window inside width for fitting, at least 2 inches window depth is required for inside mount. For example, if the window inside width and length is 30.2\"Wx72\"H, the roman shade size should be 29.8\"Wx72\"L. You can choose 30\"W*72\"L to place order then email us your window size and demand inside mount. ④ OUTSIDE MOUNT: For outside mounting, roman shade width and length need to be 3-10 inches larger than your window width and length for better covering, if there is enough space the bigger the better. For example, if the window width and length is 30.2\"Wx64\"H, we suggest the roman shade size to be 36\"Wx72\"L. You can choose 36\"Wx72\"L to place order. ⑤ Contact Us: Please contact us if have any problem after receiving the products. We can solve any problem together with you. MADE TO ORDER: We provide custom service without extra charge. Please see below about how to get a custom roman shade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k9TT5Y5LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artdix","source_asin":"B08BRVCTZ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BRVCTZ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BRVCTZ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
