window.products.push({"id":660386,"name":"Sage Green Stripe Pillow Covers Grey Stripe Throw Pillow Covers Decorative Pillow Cases for Couch Sofa Bedroom Chair Car Double Side Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m9QVC-TmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to the CAFL-life world! Pillow covers decorate your sweet home, make your life easier. About Material : Sage Green Stripe pillow covers are made of high quality faux linen, breathable,durable and comfortable.Wearing or using something made of linen nowadays has become the most popular and healthy way of living. About Printing: Grey Stripe pillow covers with double-sided printing,our pillow covers very clear and unfading.Our delicate decorative pillowcase is sure to add special features to your cozy home. About Application: Our pillow covers best for any room in your house - living room ,bedroom, guest room, kids room, RV, vacation home. Great gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. This throw pillow cover/cushion cover/decorative pillow cover can be used both indoor and outdoor. About Zipper: The pillow covers use invisible zipper for an elegant look and to avoid fraying and ripping.And it is very convenient for you to take it off for washing. About Sizes: The pillow covers have three size options available ,16 x 16/40x40cm,18 x 18 inch/45x45cm and 20×20inch/50×50cm. Washing Instructions: Pillowcase can be allowed for both hand wash and machine wash by cold or warm water are available.(Do not bleach and iron). Special Note: This size data due to different measurement methods, the error within 1-2cm is normal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m9QVC-TmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cafl","source_asin":"B0B8NMGGKP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8NMGGKP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8NMGGKP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
