window.products.push({"id":660435,"name":"Raonshua A Set of Cute Crafts Resin Sugar Skull Couple Statue Cute Statue Skull Resin Flower Delivery Decoration Figurines Small Decor Statues Ornamen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XTfoJ0c4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"description: It is a couple of sugar skulls. They are designed to sit on the ledge of something, so why they are photos of sitting on decorative boxes. Hand a flower in blue and green to a flower in orange and pink. Please note that the orange and pink design looks like awoman (she is curvy, smaller, and has eyelashes.) I am willing to change it for those who request it (for example, to make two males or two females). Please send me a message. For a while I felt pain that they could only sit on the windowsill. I thought  somepeople might not like this, so even though it was not shown, I chose to let them sit on the 3D printed black rectangle while their legs were still hanging. In this case, they will be fixed to the module as one piece (they will not loose up and down). Basic options: The \"loose\" option means that these figurines will be placed on the ledge of your choice as shown, so that their legs can be hung. They will not connect to the base. They must be placed on a ledge where feet and legs can be hung. The  \"loose\" option is the one I have in the reference photo. Their hips are flat, so they can sit on the edge of the window sill and their legs can hang down. Products include: A set of sugar skull lovers figurines","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XTfoJ0c4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pomobie","source_asin":"B092287KPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092287KPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092287KPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":660436,"name":"Pro Dispose French Onion Soup Crocks, Porcelain Ceramic Soup Bowls, 12 Ounces -Set of 4-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jvMse4VVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Serve your delicious, heart-warming soup in these 12 oz. brown and ivory onion soup crock / bowl! Serve your signature french onion soup with a top layer of baked cheese by using these 12 oz. brown and ivory china onion soup bowl. Thanks to this bowl's traditional onion soup bowl shape, your restaurant, hotel, or catering business can fill the bowl to the brim! Plus, its warm brown and ivory coloring is sure to complement vibrant tomato soup, baked beans, chili, and more. Fully Vitrified This crock / bowl is fully vitrified for superior stain resistance, low porosity, and overall durability, making it capable of withstanding the fast-paced environment of commercial kitchens and restaurants. Convenient Handles This crock / bowl features two handles on its sides for both easier carrying for your staff and to help your guests keep the bowl in place while they eat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jvMse4VVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pro Dispose","source_asin":"B07MNH265H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MNH265H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MNH265H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":660437,"name":"The Bradford Exchange Al Agnew Reflections of Nature Fully Sculpted Wolf Mirror","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71By+irGHxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The mighty wolves have long been revered for their strength, beauty and intelligence. Now, you can reflect these qualities when you gaze into the Reflections of Nature Mirror, showcasing Hall of Fame Artist Al Agnew's stirring wolf artwork in a limited edition exclusively from The Bradford Exchange. Inspired by the beauty of wolves, this magnificent wolf-themed home decor brings a breathtaking, three-dimensional encounter into your home. This 20-inch-high, handcrafted masterwork features Mr. Agnew's imagery of three wolves, hand-applied to a genuine glass mirror within a deeply dimensional frame. The handcrafted frame of artist's resin is intricately sculpted and hand-painted with the texture and look of rocks, bark and foliage. Meeting your gaze, a boldly sculpted, Agnew-inspired alpha wolf extends a full four inches from the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71By+irGHxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bradford Exchange","source_asin":"B07YBHFVYN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YBHFVYN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YBHFVYN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
