window.products.push({"id":660664,"name":"SUPERJARE 9-Shelf Tree Bookshelf, Thickened Compact Book Rack Bookcase, Display Storage Furniture for CDs, Movies & Books - Walnut Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517n8goJtXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"NO EXPENSES WERE SPARED: Quality is our top priority! Comparing to traditional and cheap tree shaped bookshelf, we have thickened the base board and main back board to reinforce the whole structure! We cost many time to improve our products! It would not fall apart like normal cheap tree bookshelves when you store large books on it! Our bookshelf size: 55.8”x 9.8”x 19.6” (H x W x L). PREMIUM QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: This 9-shelf bookcase is made of P2 Particleboard, constructed according to California’s Composite Wood Products Regulation, which means that this piece of furniture will positively affect your life POWERFUL SUPPORTS THAT WILL NOT FAIL: Equipped with 5 bottom suckers and a support bucket for extra stability, meanwhile an extra peg for fix it to the wall. Our wooden bookshelf will not easily slide around in your home or office and it will not collapse from the weight of your books! COMPACT BUT SPACIOUS: The Superjare book storage rack was made as space-saving as possible but at the same time it can hold the maximum amount of books for its size. Varying on the size and the thickness of your books, you will find that this rack can hold at least 5-10 books per shelf! EASY TO ASSEMBLE: No complicated tools, no convoluted instructions and no sweat are required to assemble this 9-shelf tree bookrack! We have installed and teared down this piece many times to update our installation manual, which is why we are confident you will find it easy to install it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517n8goJtXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERJARE","source_asin":"B07H4MSNZV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H4MSNZV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H4MSNZV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
