window.products.push({"id":660700,"name":"ProEquip Waist Apron with 3 Pockets Poly Cotton Commercial Restaurant Home Bib Spun, Black, Green, Navy, White, Royal, Red (12, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JibhiuiLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Commercial grade restaurant home 3-pocket Aprons. They can be used in restaurants or at home. Comes in 1, 3, 6, 12, 50 or 100 pack for best value. Weight is 3 oz. This great apron brings you the most economical and useful apron for less. Standard in the industry as poly-spun cotton material, this apron comes in 6 different colors, perfect for home, commercial, industrial uses. Whether you're an avid cooker intersted in culinary arts, or working as a painter, bbq host, or need some protection from the elements, this apron will be able to keep your clothes clean underneath. An added feature is that this apron can be imprinted on or embriodered for custom business logos your name, promotional items, and much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JibhiuiLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ProEquip","source_asin":"B01E60E0LE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E60E0LE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E60E0LE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
