window.products.push({"id":660874,"name":"Personal Air Conditioner with Handle Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413C2A2N9DL._AC_.jpg","description":"❄Features: Item Dimension: 15*12*22.5cm Item Weight: 700g Material: ABS plastic Power: 24V Water tank capacity: 400ml Winds speed: 3 modes (Nature / Medium / Strong) Working Time: 3~5hours(full tank) Light Mode: Random change in 7 colors Noise: ≦50DB ☃️How to Use: 1.Pull out the water box and insert the funnel into the water inlet of the water box pour the water into the funnel slowly (Not exceed the maximum water). 2.Turn on the power, the power indicator light flashes. Tap the power button and the product starts to work. The power light always keeps on. 3.Press the cooling button with the cooling light on, enter the cooling mode, and adjust the wind speed to meet your requirements. 4.Press the atmosphere lamp button to select mode, the colorful automatic changing mode or the selected monochrome light mode, long press to close it if no needed. 5.Press and hold the power button to turn off all functions, then turn off the power. ❗Note: 1.Do not tilt or tip the Mini AC after adding water to prevent the water from falling onto the table or product and causing damage. 2.Do not allow children to use and play with the product alone. 3.If you accidentally knock down the product or overflow with water, please cut off the power immediately to avoid leakage. When you use it again, you must completely dry the power port before using it. 4.The maximum amount of atomization occurs when the water level is in the middle. When there is no water (0 Level) , the atomizing function is automatically turned off. 🎁Package Includes: 1*Air Cooler 1*Manual 1*Power cord 1*Funnel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413C2A2N9DL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAPPEEY","source_asin":"B07CHBH65V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CHBH65V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CHBH65V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":660875,"name":"Lolita Love My Margarita Glass, Strawberry Fields","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41X2Be4AHyL._AC_.jpg","description":"To put it simply, at Santa Barbara Design Studio, we make what we love and we love what we make. The one and only…Lolita. It all started with a girls' night out. One that contained more than the usual laughter and fun. Browsing for the first time through a martini menu, Lolita was inspired by the recipes. After being served a Cosmopolitan, her creative imagination made her see the glass differently, the way she thought it should be, a bit more dressed up, perhaps with a pattern, with flair and with a fabulous recipe on the bottom. Lolita took hold of that original idea, hand painted martini glasses, and then took the world by storm in 2004 to become the hottest gift brand in the U.S. Now, after many successful products, designs and collections, she continues to stand behind what she has always believed...that life should be lived to its fullest and every moment should be celebrated. What is your moment? Commemorate it with a wine, margarita or martini glass, a shooter, rocks glass or pilsner. For whichever of life's big moments, there is a Lolita style to fit it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41X2Be4AHyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Barbara Design Studio","source_asin":"B007471EBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007471EBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007471EBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
