window.products.push({"id":660898,"name":"【2021 New Version】Hot Air Popcorn Popper for Home, Electric 1200W Popcorn Maker Machine with Top Cover, Healthy Snacks for Kids and Parties, Oil-Free,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZNsEH8huL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2021 New Vesion】We have done a lot of market research and we know the voice of the customer, we know how annoying it is that the popcorn flies out from the popcorn machine and we know what a waste of money leaving much-unpopped corn in the popcorn popper machine, the B022 electric air popper solved amount of problem that you got into before because have upgraded the structure and power 【Taste Delicious Popcorn in 3 Minutes at Home】With hot air swirling technology, the popping rate of this 1200W hot popcorn popper machine is up to 99%. Each grain of kernel is heated evenly by the high heat rotation of the turbine chamber to produce the delicious popcorn, which is secure and efficient enough to thoroughly pops the popcorn, almost leaving no kernel that unpopped. Let your kids taste the same healthy popcorn as the movie theater at home in 3mins 【DIY Healthy Snack by Yourself】This electric popcorn popper with hot air instead of oil for a healthy snack, allowing you to make less fat and fewer-calory food for kids and adults. You can flavor the popcorn with your favorite taste, such as sugar, chocolate, butter, sea salt, coconut oil, cheese, and peanut butter. Customize your snack just the way that you want, Your kids will like it. Note: Do not add seasoning into the popping chamber directly but drizzle over the finished popcorn. 【Enjoy the Process of Poping】Our popcorn machine is equipped with a powerful turbofan inside, ensuring the kernels to fully exposed to the hot air that pops tasty popcorn. The transparent and visible cover allows you to see the entire popping process, while the heat-resistant bowl on the bottom prevents popcorns from splashing around, Will not splash into the kitchen and make the kitchen mess and enjoy the process of producing popcorn by self 【Compact and BPA-free】The compact and portable no oil electric popcorn maker won't occupy much of your space, which is an ideal option for any kitchen, dorm room, or office. It's also an entertaining gift for family parties, allowing you to make tasty and healthy snacks within minutes for children and adults at any time without going to the cinema. 【Easy to use】The hot air popcorn machine comes with a measuring cup for you to pour a certain amount of kernels into the popping chamber. With its powerful heat ventilation performance, you can enjoy the tasty snacks by pressing the start button and waiting for about 2 minutes. Please feel free to contact us for any problem with the popcorn popper air, our friendly and professional customer service team is always here for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZNsEH8huL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EUDORS","source_asin":"B097DRXQTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097DRXQTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097DRXQTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
