window.products.push({"id":660967,"name":"CASA COPENHAGEN Premium Linea Ribbed Zero Twist Cotton 4-Pieces Hand Towels Combo, Honey Suckle & Hwain Ocean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mINm4htQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Come out of the plain pattern traditional Premium towels with our Linea collection of zero twist ribbed towels from Casa Copenhagen, in attractive modern colours. Our linea collection of terry towels are made from long staple fine cotton yarn. This yarn has zero twist that gives more softness and are more absorbent than other regular ring spun towels. De twisting the yarn opens the cotton fibers so that they can trap air and moisture between them, this increases softness and absorbency. Also it will cause all the air to reach in the deep inner parts of the yarn and will decrease the time a towel will take to dry after use or after washing. The towels will dry faster in the washing machine, thus saving energy. Our Linea collection of Zero Twist towels has cotton in the loops, the pile yarns are more open and thus they are fluffier. This means they are bulkier than regular twisted towels and when folded they will appear to be thicker and plusher. Actually our towels are 30% lighter that any regular towel and still look the same in terms of bulkiness. The ribbed design on our towels make them durable and further enhances absorbency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mINm4htQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASA COPENHAGEN","source_asin":"B07XWLHD1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XWLHD1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XWLHD1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
