window.products.push({"id":660977,"name":"Al Bramony EL Bramony ELBramony Copper Brass Greek Turkish Coffee Maker Burner Table Top Tabletop With Wooden Handle Arabian Arabic Solid Large Size H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717VWlRQOJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Item Description : Professionally Handmade Brass Tabletop Burner With Metal Brass Handle. Now You Can Taste The Real Turkish Coffee This Package Includes Qty (1) Brass Tabletop Burner Turkish Coffee Maker. Qty (1) Brass Flame Cover. Qty (1) Plastic Filling Flask Aid Handcrafted In Egypt!!! Our Items Are Handmade By Highly Skillful Craftsmen In Egypt!! Important Notice : The Color And Design Of The Wooden Hands Is Usually Changeable We Cant Make Sure That You Will Get Identical Color And Design As Pictures Shown In The Listing But In Case Of Changing You Will Get One Of Those Shown In The Picture Bellow. In Case Of Buying Complete Set , You Will Receive Of Course The Whole Set With One Design And One Color Quantity : 1 Pcs Color : Gold Tone Weight (Approx.) : 12.45 oz / 353 gm Material : Solid Brass Size (Approx.) : Width Without ( The Handle) : 5.2' / 13 cm Height : 5\" / 12.5 cm Used To Make Turkish Arabian Coffee ( Without Electricity ) With Such Real Solid Hard Brass This Burner Will Last For Years And Years The Ideal Way To Make Thick Turkish Coffee Foam Amazing Detail And Craftsmanship. Will Definitely Add A Decorative Look To Your Corner. Can Be Used Anywhere Any Time No Need To Electric Source ( Camping -Home ) How To Serve A Great Turkish Coffee ?? 1. Measure The Amount Of Cold Water You Will Need. 2. Place Your Pot Of Water On The Stove And Turn The Heat To Medium - High ( Just Until The Water Heats Up ). 3. Add About 1-2 Heaping Tea Spoons Of Coffee Per Cup. Do Not Stir It Yet. Just Let The Coffee \"Float\" On The Surface Because If You Stir It Now You Will Cause It To Clump Up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717VWlRQOJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELBARAMONY","source_asin":"B00K49U5UW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K49U5UW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K49U5UW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":660978,"name":"Arfntevss 100% Waterproof Corner Sectional Couch Covers L Shape Sofa Cover for Dogs Stretch Jacquard U Shaped Slipcovers Set Living Room Anti Slip Fur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y-1SN9qSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Waterproof: The fabric has a water proof coating on the surface and a waterproof membrane on the back, the innovative double waterproof sectional couch covers l shape protects your sofa from liquid damage, such as accidentally spilled water in life, cat and dog urine, etc. In addition, the water resistant l shaped sofa cover sectional also protects the sofa from stains, daily wear, scratches, dog hair, especially suitable for families with pets and children High Stretch: Made of High density 85% polyester and 15% spandex jacquard fabric, it is a super stretchable elastic sofa cover that can be stretched a lot to fit the sofa, and because it is 1-piece design, it works for various kinds of corner sectional couches. The universal stretchy sofa slipcovers is suitable for couches with the length of 157-177 inches. Please check the measurement guide in the picture before buying Suitable for Year-round Use: High quality jacquard corner couch cover, which is super soft, breathable, thick and skin-friendly, lying on the couch slipcover is particularly comfortable. The l shaped couch cover fabric has high gram weight, it is thick and durable, can effectively prevent cats and dogs from scratching. Adopting active printing and dyeing technology, the sectional sofa cover does not fade, does not pilling, does not wrinkle Non-slip: Firstly, the bottom of the corner sectional couch cover l shape has high elastic edge and fixed belt to ensure that the sofa protector cover can be fixed and no sliding. Secondly, the l shape couch cover comes with foam rods to be inserted into the gaps of the sofa cushions, not only make the sectional cover more anti-slip, also look more smooth and nice. It's a must-have sofa covers for sectional sofa set for living room Installation and washing: The premium sectional slipcover is easy to install in 5 minutes. Please check the installation instruction in the pictures. The couch protector cover can be hand wash or machine washable on the gentle cycle, separately in cold water. Do not bleach. Do not iron, hang dry. Do not turn the reverse coated side outside in machine washing. You will get our brand's Worry-free 24-month warranty for the furniture cover","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y-1SN9qSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arfntevss","source_asin":"B0B8YFB85D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-660978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8YFB85D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8YFB85D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
